    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="Epilog">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> Epilog</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Ealle ðis wæs gesetted on ðam miclan synoþ æt Greatanleage; on þam wæs se ærcebisceop Wulfhelme mid eallum þæm æþelum mannum ⁊ wiotan, ðe Æþelstan cyning mihte gegadrian.] [Ld]</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">All this was established at the great assembly at Grately, at which Archbishop Wulfhelm was present, with all the nobles and councillors whom King Æthelstan had assembled.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ealle ðis wæs gesetted on ðam miclan synoþ æt Greatanleage; on þam wæs se ærcebisceop Wulfhelme mid eallum þæm æþelum mannum ⁊ wiotan, ðe Æþelstan cyning mihte gegadrian.</ab>
      </div>
